+### Optional live process expansion
+
+A presentation consumer may set `liveProcessExpansion: true` with `stepGrouping: 'collapsed'` to open each active process until its own group becomes closed. An ordinary response closes the preceding process even while the Turn remains open. Explicit user disclosure choices take precedence for that group's mounted lifetime. Omitting the option preserves existing DSH behavior; group identities, member parents and reading anchors are unchanged.
